  'after_supervisor_brief',
  state.run_context
)
→ CheckpointInfo: checkpoint_id, phase, path, written
→ checkpoint_hash im JSON-Payload
→ atomarer Write via .tmp + replace" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fef9c3;strokeColor=#ca8a04;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fontColor=#713f12;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1290" y="2020" width="610" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="handoff_gate" value="&lt;b&gt;Step1Handoff Contract + Gate&lt;/b&gt;
build_step1_handoff(...)
schema_version · run_id · intake · supervisor_message
question_registry + answer_matrix
retrieval snapshots · runtime_agents_snapshot
storage_snapshot · budget_snapshot
first_event + checkpoint
readiness: ready_for_department_routing / ready_with_gaps / blocked_step1_handoff
handoff_allows_department_routing(...) gates Step 2" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e0e7ff;strokeColor=#4338ca;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fontColor=#312e81;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1290" y="2180" width="610" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="handoff" value="&lt;b&gt;Step 1 Boundary — Handoff an Step 2&lt;/b&gt;
returns SupervisorBriefResult(
  brief, supervisor_message, step1_handoff
)

Nächster Aufruf in run_pipeline():
if handoff_allows_department_routing(...):
  first_pass = _run_first_pass(state, brief=supervisor.brief)
  → run_supervisor_loop(brief, run_context, agents, on_message)
else: failed_phase='step1_handoff'" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fee2e2;strokeColor=#dc2626;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fontColor=#7f1d1d;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1290" y="2370" width="610" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
